  "description": "Break an epic or a design document into owned, sequenced tasks: one deliverable each, an owner, a dependency order, the parallel lanes that avoid two people editing the same file, and a definition of done per task. Use before a sprint starts, when work has to be shared across several developers, or when a piece of work needs owners and parallel lanes. Work that stays with one person is planned with `atk:plan` instead, however many days it takes. Triggers on: \"break down\", \"breakdown\", \"split this epic\", \"task list\", \"WBS\", \"who does what\", \"assign tasks\", \"/atk:breakdown\".",
